    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "SNMP RPC payload size, request vs response (p95)",
      "description": "95th-percentile serialized message size for snmp RPC requests and responses. Kafka's default max message size is 1 MB (the OpenNMS Kafka RPC module chunks beyond it); responses growing toward that ceiling mean more chunking, more round trips per logical request, and earlier producer-buffer pressure. If response p95 jumps after a fleet change, the collection request grew, not Kafka.",
